      resolutionCriterion: pair("제한된 해결은 동일 lot의 최소 60개 cell, 공통 EOL definition, 반복된 사용조건과 초기 반복진단을 가진 새 source에서 판정한다. 네 zero-weight schema pilot와 최대 여덟 calibration cell만 연 뒤 30개 이상 EOL target과 전체 사용영역을 숨긴다. Stress-only·static BoL·초기 변화율·변화율+physics arm을 비교해 초기 변화율 arm이 static 대비 MdAPE를 25% 이상 줄이고, 모든 eligible regime의 within-regime Spearman이 0.50 이상이며, 80% interval coverage와 width, 한 calibration cell 제거 영향, mechanism ordering을 동시에 통과해야 한다. 이 조건은 선언한 chemistry와 duty 범위만 해결하며 pack·calendar·safety로 자동 확장되지 않는다.", "A bounded solution requires a new same-lot source with at least sixty cells, a common end-of-life definition, replicated usage conditions, and repeated early diagnostics. Only four zero-weight schema pilots and at most eight calibration cells may be opened, leaving at least thirty EOL targets and complete usage regimes sealed. Stress-only, static-BoL, early-change, and early-change-plus-physics arms must be compared. The early-change arm must reduce MdAPE at least twenty-five percent relative to static BoL, achieve within-regime Spearman of at least 0.50 in every eligible regime, and jointly pass 80% interval coverage and width, leave-one-calibration influence, and mechanism-ordering gates. Passing resolves only the declared chemistry and duty range, not pack, calendar, or safety behavior."),
