    selectionReason: "RC52의 다음 출발점이었던 fifth-source orthogonal proxy를 그대로 추적했다. 압력·팽창·EIS 후보들은 독립 cell이 1–10개라 최소 30개 조건을 통과하지 못했다. Imperial LG M50T 자료는 40개 cell, 15개 운전조건, 공통 RPT8, RPT0 electrode fit과 GITT resistance를 제공했다. 그러나 공통 EOL이 없음을 확인해 lifetime gate를 억지로 적용하지 않고, 22개 complete-regime holdout의 mechanism-bridge 시험으로 범위를 줄였다.",
    selectionReasonEn: "RC53 follows RC52's exact next start: a fifth source with an orthogonal proxy. Pressure, expansion, and EIS candidates had only one to ten independent cells and failed the minimum-thirty criterion. The Imperial LG M50T source provides forty cells, fifteen operating conditions, a common RPT8, RPT0 electrode fits, and GITT resistance. After confirming that it lacks a common EOL, the cycle does not force a lifetime gate; it narrows the claim to a mechanism-bridge test with twenty-two complete-regime holdouts.",
    summary: pair("공식 metadata의 40개 cell 중 네 개는 값이 model에 들어가지 않는 schema pilot, Expt 1·3의 14개는 development, Expt 2,2·4·5의 22개는 untouched target으로 결과 전에 봉인했다. Stress-only·초기 capacity·초기 electrode/resistance passport를 같은 ridge로 비교했다. Target MdAE는 6.38·5.70·10.55%p였고 passport는 error를 악화시켰다. Pooled Spearman 0.624는 좋아 보였지만 experiment 평균을 제거하면 -0.012였으며 세 regime 평균을 6.7–9.7%p 낮게 예측했다. 네 hypothesis를 통과시키지 않았고 Python·Node는 117개 비교에 합의했다. 다음 경로는 static BoL feature를 더 고르는 것이 아니라 표준 perturbation 전후의 early state derivative를 common-EOL source에서 blind 판정하는 것이다.", "Four of forty official metadata cells are zero-weight schema pilots, fourteen cells from experiments 1 and 3 are development, and twenty-two cells from experiments 2,2, 4, and 5 are untouched targets, all sealed before results. Stress-only, initial-capacity, and initial electrode/resistance passports are compared with the same ridge. Target MdAEs are 6.38, 5.70, and 10.55 percentage points, so the passport worsens error. Pooled Spearman appears promising at 0.624, but falls to -0.012 after removing experiment means, while the three regime means are underpredicted by 6.7 to 9.7 points. None of four hypotheses is advanced, and Python and Node agree across 117 comparisons. The next route is not selecting more static BoL features, but blindly adjudicating an early state derivative across a standardized perturbation in a common-EOL source."),
